          {
            "title": "Question: Multiple classes",
            "id": 77832,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa c'è che non va in questo codice?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;bold, underlined&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Eye doctor offers free eye exams for NFL\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   referees after Saints loss\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">C'è una virgola tra le classi CSS</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dovrebbe esserci un punto e virgola invece di una virgola</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">C'è una virgola tra le classi CSS.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per combinare gli stili, inserisci i nomi delle classi in un unico attributo <code>class</code>, separati da spazi.</p><p>Il paragrafo deve usare le classi <code>bold</code> e <code>underlined</code>. Perché il valore attuale non le applica correttamente?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;bold, underlined&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Eye doctor offers free eye exams for NFL\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   referees after Saints loss\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">La virgola diventa parte di <code>bold,</code>, quindi non corrisponde a <code>bold</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">La classe <code>underlined</code> deve precedere <code>bold</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ogni nome di classe richiede un attributo <code>class</code> distinto</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">La virgola diventa parte di <code>bold,</code>, quindi non corrisponde a <code>bold</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: More classes",
            "id": 77833,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché usiamo più classi CSS?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Per combinare più stili nel nostro HTML</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Creare altre classi CSS che fanno la stessa cosa</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Per combinare più stili nel nostro HTML.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un paragrafo richiede gli stili delle classi <code>bold</code> e <code>underlined</code>. Quale attributo applica entrambe le classi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>class=\"bold underlined\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>class=\"bold, underlined\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>class=\"bold\" class=\"underlined\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>class=\"bold underlined\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
